270 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Executives and organizations are exceptionally good at codifying success through retrospectives\054 personal playbooks\054 and frameworks\056 But they may struggle with letting go of the assumptions\054 habits\054 and past logics that no longer serve them in new contexts\056\n\nThis takeaway invites us to flip the script\072\240strategic maturity isn\031t just about learning more\054 it\031s about knowing when to unlearn\056\240AI can play a critical role here\054 not by adding insight\054 but by gently challenging institutional muscle memory\056)
     /K [ 4 ]
     /P 271 0 R
     /Pg 262 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

